        "description": "TPS3703 voltage supervisor monitoring the VCC_3V3 rail. VDD is powered by VCC_3V3. The SENSE pin provides independent monitoring of the VCC_3V3 rail. The MR (Manual Reset) pin is pulled up to VDD to disable manual reset. The CT pin connects to GND via a capacitor to set the reset time delay. The RESET output acts as an open-drain POWER_GOOD signal, requiring a pull-up resistor to VDD.",
